   "copyCode": "<section class=\"py-12 lg:py-24 bg-ss-gray/60\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"flex max-lg:justify-center max-lg:gap-y-3 max-lg:flex-wrap -mx-8\"><div class=\"px-8 lg:w-[45%] xl:w-auto\"><figure class=\"max-w-[501px]\"><img src=\"./assets/images/about-img01.png\" width=\"501\" height=\"575\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"step feature image\"></figure></div><div class=\"px-8 lg:flex-1 [&_p]:mb-2\"><span class=\"block font-lead text-danger text-base font-bold uppercase pb-3 relative mb-4\">Our Story<span class=\"absolute bottom-0 flex items-center gap-1 left-0\"><span class=\"block w-4 h-[2px] bg-primary\"></span><span class=\"block w-[41px] h-[2px] bg-primary\"></span></span></span><h2>Tanya Martinez-<span>Cardenas</span></h2><span class=\"block text-black lg:text-2xl uppercase font-normal font-lead mb-4\">Owner, LPC, LCDC, ADC, ICADC, DOT SAP</span><p>Hi, I'm Tanya. Welcome. Whatever brings you here, I want you to know I've been in recovery for more than 14 years now. I know what it's like to feel, as if you are living out your own hell. If you're here,</p><p>I'm guessing you know what I'm talking about. It's because of where I've been that makes me who I am today. This is why you are not just another visitor who has landed on my page. To me you are a person that I am fortunate enough to meet, because I'm alive today.</p><div class=\"flex max-sm:gap-y-3 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:items-start max-lg:items-center -mx-2 xl:-mx-3 pt-4 xl:pt-8\"><div class=\"px-2 xl:px-3 max-sm:mx-auto\"><figure><img src=\"./assets/images/our-story01.jpg\" width=\"268\" height=\"153\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"step feature image\"></figure></div><div class=\"px-2 xl:px-3 max-sm:mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex max-lg:items-center gap-2 xl:gap-3 lg:pr-[13%] mb-4 xl:mb-8\"><i class=\"icon-brain text-[30px] lg:text-[45px] text-ss-green font-medium\"></i><strong class=\"text-black xl:text-xl italic\">What we do is a calling; it’s not just a job.</strong></div><div class=\"max-sm:text-center\"><a href=\"#footer-form\" class=\"js-has-smooth btn btn-secondary\">Learn More</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>"
