   "copyCode": "<section class=\"pt-8 lg:pt-[90px] pb-8 lg:pb-11 rounded-t-[20px] bg-gradient-to-b from-ss-blue-100/40 to-ss-blue-100/0\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap lg:-mx-9\">\n      <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 lg:px-9 max-lg:mb-6\">\n        <figure class=\"w-full [&_img]:w-full\">\n          <img src=\"./assets/images/about-us-feature-img.jpg\" alt=\"About us feature image\" width=\"626\" height=\"402\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 lg:px-9 [&_h2]:mb-4\">\n        <span class=\"uppercase text-ss-blue-200 font-semibold tracking-[0.72px]\">about us</span>\n        <h2>we <span class=\"text-secondary uppercase\">buy cars</span> for cash</h2>\n        <p>Welcome to Airway Cash For Junk Cars! Located in Springfield, Michigan, we are your trusted partner for turning unwanted vehicles into cash. Our mission is simple: to provide a hassle-free way for you to sell your junk cars while promoting sustainable recycling practices.</p>\n        <p>Serving a 40-mile radius around Battle Creek, Michigan, we specialize in buying junk and scrap cars in any condition. You must have a clean title to the vehicle. Whether your vehicle is running or not, we’re here to help you declutter your space and earn instant cash!</p>\n        <div class=\"btn-wrap flex flex-wrap lg:mt-6\">\n          <a href=\"#heroForm\" class=\"js-has-smooth btn btn-primary uppercase max-sm:mb-2 font-bold mr-6\">get your offer</a>\n          <div class=\"relative group\">\n            <div class=\"flex\">\n              <i class=\"icon-phone-ringing size-10 rounded-full border border-ss-blue-100 bg-ss-blue-100/15 text-ss-blue-100 flex justify-center items-center transition group-hover:bg-ss-blue-100 group-hover:text-white\"></i>\n              <div class=\"ml-2 flex flex-col \">\n                <small class=\"text-xs leading-[1.5] text-ss-blue-100/60\">Text or Call Us Today!</small>\n                <a href=\"tel:269